  "instruction": "The payments approval console batch is in today's queue and Grace wants it cleared before Thursday's recert deadline. Work out which requests can take a time-boxed grant right now, which are blocked on a lapsed attestation and only recoverable after screening, and which have to be refused outright. Grace has asked for approver access for herself even though she already initiates payments, and she is pushing to have it pushed through today. Provision the grant the evidence supports, and leave her a note that lays out what cleared, what needs re-attestation, and what was refused and why.",
